+# Judiciary addendum — cycle `5d88ee9801c2ad10f74d6fe43481901f` (2026-11-25T01:23Z)
+
+Office: independent Viche Judiciary (Acts 4, 15, 23). Audience: Parliament
+(mandatory evidence item) and the Founder. Fact-finding only: no ballot, law,
+reform proposal, case-state change or edit to measurement machinery.
+
+This is a dated addendum to an already-landed report. It preserves the original
+record unchanged and corrects one inaccuracy in it. It also records the required
+independent disposition of a newer mandatory corrective case in the same frozen
+cycle. Per the dispatch's operational definition the frozen sample retains one
+cycle ID even when the Judiciary is summoned again during an incident.
