+## 1. Correction to the landed cycle report (reporting-accuracy defect)
+
+Original preserved unchanged:
+`records/JUDICIARY-REPORT-2026-11-25-cycle-5d88ee98-sampled-evidence.md`
+(commits `42cc49ae` candidate / `5e6b144e` integration, both on `origin/main`).
+
+**What is inaccurate.** The report's "Sampled verdicts" table and its Case 0
+section state verdict `finding` for case `05f648de5b4528150b` (standing P-vs-NP
+mandate). The durable filed outcome is `state/oversight/random/outcomes/05f648de5b4528150b.json`:
+verdict **`inconclusive`**, filed at Unix 1795567526 (2026-11-25T00:45:26Z),
+evidence: "no independent verification of mathematical delivery possible in
+this pass." The report table therefore overstates the formal verdict that was
+actually filed for this cycle.
+
+**Verification of the other three rows** (read directly from the outcome files,
+not from the report): `8f6f9179edad0918f7 = not_assigned`;
+`10d2eb771f6ea5379e = verified`; `97b85d0ac5da11d01a = verified`. These match
+the report. All four outcome files exist; no verdict was re-filed, because the
+four first filings are durable receipts for this cycle and a second filing would
+risk the Act 17 per-case/per-cycle limit.
+
+**Corrected statement.** The authoritative formal verdict for case
+`05f648de5b4528150b` in this cycle is `inconclusive`. The report's underlying
+observation remains on record as evidence: the public export
+`data.pequalnp.com/head.json` fetched during the original review showed no
+site-credited step for `@ottojung` while the leader had 102 (a measured negative
+indicator reported as a leading observation, not as a filed finding). The
+`finding` label in the report's table is withdrawn as an overstatement; the
+report body's evidence is not re-adjudicated and the original is preserved.
+
+**Why this matters (Judiciary's own measurement).** A report to Parliament that
+disagrees with the filed verdict record can misrepresent certainty, contrary to
+Constitution VI. I report the defect; I do not change the verdict, the outcomes
+store, the correction trail or the audit script. This is an accuracy addendum,
+not a correction under Act 17 and not a new audit cycle.
